# Geist / Vercel Design System

Sources of truth:

- [Geist Introduction](https://vercel.com/geist/introduction)
- [Geist Colors](https://vercel.com/geist/colors)
- [Geist Typography](https://vercel.com/geist/typography)
- [Geist Materials](https://vercel.com/geist/materials)
- [Brand guidelines](https://vercel.com/geist/brands) — do not misuse Vercel/Next marks; Sioona stays its own brand
- [Web Interface Guidelines](https://vercel.com/design/guidelines)

Product SoT (what we build): Phase 1 Shadow Mode Insights. Visual SoT (how it looks): Vercel/Geist principles — not Vercel branding, not navy+cyan.

## Typography

- **UI/body**: Geist Sans
- **Code/data/tabular**: Geist Mono (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for comparable numbers)
- Prefer typography roles: `heading-*`, `label-*`, `copy-*` (see Geist typography)
- Default body: copy-14 / label-14. Headings: tight tracking, weight 600

## Color (light theme — product default)

Use `--ds-*` tokens. Step meaning: `100` bg → `200` hover → `300` active → `400` border → `500`/`600` border hover/active → `900` secondary text → `1000` primary text.

Page: `background-100` (#fff). `color-scheme: light` on `<html>`. `theme-color` matches page background.

Accent color signals **state**, not decoration (lead=blue, retention=amber, upsell=teal). Pair color with text/icon.

## Density & spacing

- Rhythm: 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 (`--space-*`)
- Prefer `gap-4` / `gap-6` between page sections; avoid stacked bordered boxes
- Controls default height **36px** (`h-9`); filters/nav chrome **32px** (`h-8`)

## Surface ladder

1. **Flush** — no border (page chrome, dividers only)
2. **Quiet** — `.surface-quiet` / `.metric-strip` (border, transparent)
3. **Panel** — `.panel` (`rounded-sm` + border; near-zero shadow)
4. **Group** — `.panel-group` (`rounded-md`) only for large grouped regions

Borders + tonal fills first; avoid card-on-card nesting.

## Shell / sidebar

- Desktop (`md+`): fixed left sidebar (~240px), logo, icon+label nav, quiet Sign In footer
- Mobile: top bar + slide-over drawer (focus trap, Escape, `overscroll-behavior: contain`)
- Selected nav: `gray-alpha-200` fill + primary text (not colored pills)

## Components

- **Primary**: `gray-1000` fill, `background-100` text, 6px, medium weight
- **Secondary**: border `gray-alpha-400`; hover border `500`
- **Tertiary**: text only; hover `gray-alpha` tint
- **Focus**: `0 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 0 4px` blue-700
- Icons: Lucide, `strokeWidth={1.5}`, 16px, gray-900 at rest
- Loading labels end with `…`

## Web interface rules (must follow)

- Keyboard operable; links are real `<a>`/`Link`
- Hit targets ≥24px (44px mobile); `touch-action: manipulation`
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`; never `transition: all`
- Title Case for buttons/nav/titles; sentence case for body/helpers
- Action labels: verb + noun; empty/error states offer a next step

## Do not

- Dark mode as product default; atmospheric glows, orbit/grid/star backdrops, luminous pill chrome
- Use Slash gold/Inter/Instrument Serif stacks
- Use Vercel logo/marks in a way that implies endorsement
- Navy+cyan or purple glows / non-token neon accents
- Import Vercel brand CSS or invent a parallel token system
